      "toNode": "ca10000000000009",
      "toSide": "top",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "A finite positive ratio limit supplies two eventual positive comparison multiples / 比值趋于有限正常数，最终给出双向正常数倍比较"
    },
    {
      "id": "cae0000000000007",
      "fromNode": "ca10000000000006",
