      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Tail p>1 versus near-zero p<1; check both if present / 尾部 p>1、零端 p<1；两端都有就分别查"
    },
    {
      "id": "cae0000000000008",
      "fromNode": "ca10000000000008",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "ca1000000000000b",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Local comparison suffices when every omitted contribution is finite / 略去部分均积分有限时，只需在问题端附近比较"
    },
    {
      "id": "cae000000000000a",
      "fromNode": "ca10000000000007",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "ca1000000000000d",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Neither implication holds in general; each direction has its own counterexample / 两个方向一般都不成立，各有自己的反例"
    },
    {
      "id": "cae000000000000b",
      "fromNode": "ca10000000000004",
